      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft incorporating that firm phrasing: \"We are aware of a recent technical service interruption affecting our customer database portal. Our comprehensive investigation has confirmed that absolutely no customer data was compromised during this incident, and all sensitive information remains fully secure across our systems. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this interruption may have caused.\" This statement delivers a resolute message of security while addressing the event publicly.",
